msgstr "Duben 2026 {#april-2026}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Introducing the Executor primitive**: We're excited to announce the release of the new `Executor` primitive and a new version of the noise-learning helper class, `NoiseLearnerV3`, both of which were first previewed at QDC 2025.\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"executor-primitive\"></span>\n"
"- **Představujeme primitiv Executor**: S nadšením oznamujeme vydání nového primitivu `Executor` a nové verze pomocné třídy pro učení se šumu `NoiseLearnerV3`, které byly poprvé představeny na QDC 2025.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Together with "
"[Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html), they make up"
" the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which "
"provides full transparency and control to fine-tune your error mitigation "
"workflow. The [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded "
"lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html) tutorial, for example, demonstrates "
"how this model is used to combine advanced techniques, including shaded "
"lightcones, probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error "
"eXtinction (TREX), and [measurement-based postselection](/guides/post-"
"selection), to further improve the result quality.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Spolu se [Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) "
"tvoří [direktivní model spouštění](/guides/directed-execution-model), který "
"poskytuje plnou transparentnost a kontrolu pro doladění pracovního postupu "
"error mitigation. Tutoriál [Probabilistic error cancellation with shaded "
"lightcones](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"slc/tutorials/01_getting_started.html) například demonstruje, jak se tento "
"model používá ke kombinování pokročilých technik, včetně shaded lightcones, "
"probabilistic error cancellation (PEC), Twirled Readout Error eXtinction "
"(TREX) a [postselekce na základě měření](/guides/post-selection), pro další "
"zlepšení kvality výsledků.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  If you prefer a higher level of abstraction, "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) in Qiskit Runtime "
"continues to provide several built-in error mitigation and suppression "
"techniques, which you can easily tune using the "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level) "
"option.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Pokud preferuješ vyšší úroveň abstrakce, "
"[`EstimatorV2`](/guides/estimator-noise-management) v Qiskit Runtime nadále "
"poskytuje několik vestavěných technik error mitigation a potlačování chyb, "
"které lze snadno ladit pomocí možnosti "
"[`resilience_level`](/guides/estimator-noise-management#resilience-level).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
